@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
### Звичайний пошук
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/search?q=навчальн
### Легітимний апостроф
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/search?q=O%27Brien

### incident creation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": " Test incident T-01 ",
  "description": " Training description of a successfully created incident ",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-01-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### invalid severity
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test invalid severity",
  "description": "Checking server validation",
  "severity": "7",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-01-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### missing occurredAtUtc
POST http://localhost:5080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test missing date",
  "description": "Checking missing occurredAtUtc",
  "severity": "Medium"
}

### 5 min time check
POST http://localhost:5080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test future date",
  "description": "Checking future date",
  "severity": "Medium",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2099-01-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### Title length check
POST http://localhost:5080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Checking max title length",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-01-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### empty title and desc
POST http://localhost:5080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": " ",
  "description": " ",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-01-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### Testing vulnerbility fix
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/search?q=O%27Brien
Accept: application/json